<title>MEXICO: Telmex buys small telcoms company.</title>
<headline>Telmex buys small telcoms company.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pulsar Venture Group, a subsidiary of Pulsar International, said on Tuesday it had sold its share of kb/TEL Telecommunicationes, S.A. de C.V. to Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex).</p>
<p>The deal was worth $22 million, Pulsar said in a news release.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
</text>
